English Dictionary Application
====================================

DATASET ATTRIBUTION
-------------------
The dictionary definitions, synonyms, antonyms, semantic relations, and pronunciation data used in this application are derived from Open English WordNet 2025.

Open English WordNet is provided under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0).
License URL: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Project Name: Open English WordNet 2025
Project URL: https://en-word.net/

TRANSFORMATIONS
---------------
In accordance with the CC BY 4.0 license, this project acknowledges that the original Open English WordNet dataset was modified. The source data was parsed, deduplicated, and normalized into a custom JSON/MongoDB schema for optimal search and retrieval within this application.

ORIGINAL PRINCETON WORDNET ACKNOWLEDGMENT
-----------------------------------------
Open English WordNet is itself derived from the original Princeton WordNet created by Princeton University. We acknowledge the foundational work of the Princeton WordNet project.

APPLICATION CODE
----------------
The source code of the English Dictionary Application is a separate work from the dictionary dataset and is not covered by the CC BY 4.0 dataset license. (Application code licensing is currently undeclared unless otherwise specified in a separate code license file).
